# REID v9.3 Changelog
Consolidated Engineering Edition

This changelog documents all notable changes to the REID architecture
from version v9.2 to v9.3. Entries are listed in chronological order
and grouped by category for clarity.

============================================================
## Version 9.3 (2026-10-11)
============================================================

### Major Additions
- Added SIL-v9.3 (Synthesis Integrity Lock) as a Kernel primitive.
- Added deterministic fallback convergence rules.
- Added ATS-v9.3 packet ordering and temporal ledger rules.
- Added latency ceilings to API-MAP-PACK.
- Added formal schema appendices (Protobuf and OpenAPI).
- Added PACK-INDEX-v9.3.
- Added CONFORMANCE.md.
- Added SECURITY.md.
- Added CONTRIBUTING.md.
- Added CODEOWNERS.

### Governance and Safety
- Introduced SIL-state enforcement for all corpus-carrying emissions.
- Updated AAG-v9.3 directive routing and enforcement.
- Added GF-CLASS-1 triggers for epoch regression and SIL mismatch.
- Added governance envelope clarifications in CL-PACK.

### Temporal and Epoch
- Added Epoch 093 declaration.
- Added strict epoch monotonicity rules.
- Added ATS ordering reconciliation and gap detection.
- Added temporal drift ceiling (<= 0.01).

### Drift and Coherence
- Lowered corpus drift ceiling from <= 0.12 to <= 0.10.
- Lowered cross-domain drift ceiling from <= 0.04 to <= 0.03.
- Added infrastructure coherence floor (>= 0.92).
- Added temporal coherence floor (>= 0.90).

### PACK Updates
- Updated L1-PACK-v9.3 with substrate invariants.
- Updated L2-PACK-v9.3 with recursion limit (delta_limit).
- Updated L3-PACK-v9.3 with coherence enforcement rules.
- Updated L4-PACK-v9.3 with Binding Chain routing.
- Updated L5-PACK-v9.3 with governance envelope refinements.
- Updated T-PACK-v9.3 with epoch physics and ATS integration.
- Updated API-MAP-PACK-v9.3 with latency ceilings and SIL-lock rules.

### Schemas
- Added authoritative field-ID definitions for SIL-v9.3.
- Added authoritative field-ID definitions for AAG-v9.3.
- Added ATS-v9.3 schema alignment.
- Added Binding Chain schema definitions.
- Added OpenAPI 3.1 schema maps.

### Infrastructure
- Updated Azure + Homestead deployment templates.
- Added SIL registry deployment.
- Added drift telemetry deployment.
- Added AAG sidecar deployment.

### Documentation
- Added Origin Story.
- Added Epoch 093.
- Added PACK Index.
- Added Release Notes.
- Added Conformance Specification.
- Added Security Policy.
- Added Contribution Guide.
- Added Codeowners file.
- Updated README.md with full repository structure.

============================================================
## Version 9.2 (2026-10-06)
============================================================

### Summary
- Introduced PACK suite structure.
- Added governance envelopes.
- Added initial drift and coherence physics.
- Added early temporal rules.
- Added infrastructure PACKs.
- Added UC-PACK and CL-PACK.
- Added API-MAP-PACK v9.2.

============================================================
## Version 9.1 (2026-10-03)
============================================================

### Summary
- Introduced IC-PACK.
- Added implicit cognition rules.
- Added early epoch validation logic.

============================================================
## Version 9.0 (2026-09)
============================================================

### Summary
- Initial formalization of REID architecture.
- Early Binding Chain definition.
- Early drift physics.
- Early coherence rules.

============================================================
End of Changelog
